From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:11:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add explicit bounded journal recovery storage checkpoints

Integration review note (2026-10-15; original source commit had no body):
Add opt-in bounded recovery journals and undo fingerprints. Publish journal
progress with the active state in one synchronous batch, fence ordinary writers
and test restart, quotas, corruption and ambiguous WAL failures.

